---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, reseller } from '../config';
const seller = reseller();

const { legal } = SITE;
const updated = 'October 14, 2026';
---
<Base title="Refund policy" description={`Lagsmith Pro comes with a ${legal.refundDays}-day, no-questions-asked refund.`} breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Refund policy', href: '/refunds' }]}>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <h1>Refund policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated {updated}</p>
      <p class="lead">If Lagsmith Pro isn’t right for you, you can get a full refund within {legal.refundDays} days of purchase. No questions asked.</p>

      <h2>How to get a refund</h2>
      <p>Either:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.supportEmail}?subject=Refund%20request`}>{SITE.supportEmail}</a> from the address you bought with, or include your order number, or</li>
        <li>request it from {seller.name}, our reseller, through <a href={seller.refundSite.url} rel="noopener">{seller.refundSite.label}</a>, using the email address you bought with.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You don’t need to give a reason, though we’re always glad to hear what didn’t work for you.</p>

      <h2>What happens next</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>{seller.name}, the merchant of record for our orders, refunds the full amount, including any tax, to your original payment method.</li>
        <li>Refunds usually appear within 5 to 10 business days, depending on your bank.</li>
        <li>Your licence for that purchase ends, and Lagsmith goes back to the free version.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>After {legal.refundDays} days</h2>
      <p>After {legal.refundDays} days we don’t normally give refunds, but if something has gone wrong, such as a duplicate purchase or Lagsmith not working on your Mac, email us and we’ll sort it out.</p>

      <h2>Try before you buy</h2>
      <p>Every install includes a 14-day Pro trial with everything unlocked, so you can check that Lagsmith works for you before buying.</p>

      <p>This policy doesn’t affect your legal rights, including any right to withdraw from a purchase under the consumer laws of your country.</p>
      <p>See also our <a href="/terms">terms</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
